<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> March 19, 2026</p>

<h2>What We Collect</h2>
<p>When you sign in with Google, we receive your <strong>email address</strong> and basic profile information (name, profile picture URL) from Google. We store only your email address to identify your account.</p>
<p>If you create an account with email and password, we store your email and a securely hashed version of your password. We never store passwords in plain text.</p>

<h2>How We Use Your Data</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Authenticate you and maintain your session.</li>
  <li>Associate your character sheets, adventures, and other content with your account.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties.</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Google OAuth</strong> — used for sign-in. Google's privacy policy applies to data processed on their end.</li>
  <li><strong>OpenAI</strong> — game content you create may be sent to OpenAI's API for AI-assisted features. No personally identifiable information is included in those requests.</li>
  <li><strong>Sentry</strong> — error monitoring in production. May capture your user ID and email for debugging purposes.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data Retention</h2>
<p>Your data is retained as long as your account is active. You may request deletion of your account and associated data by contacting us.</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>We use a session cookie to keep you logged in. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy-related questions, reach out via the email listed in the application.</p>
